  _continueHint: {fileID: 0}
  _dialogueStartRange: 8
  _advanceKey: 19
  _dialogueLines:
  - The threads of fate have led you here. And now, the tapestry will be complete.
    Welcome, little one, to the end of your journey.
  - You think you are the hero who will save this world? No, little one. You are
    merely the final piece of the puzzle. The last line of code needed to complete
    the system.
  - The Null Engine is ready. And now... the garbage collection begins.
